Hello,  I have PCNetHack 3.0(j, I'm pretty sure), and I happen to disagree
about how worthless spells are in this version.  I found a blessed spellbook
of identify on about level 7, that gave me the equivelent of around 7 or 8
blessed scrolls of indentify.  I also have found a spellbook of restore
ability which has saved my bacon a couple of times.  Fireball and cone of
cold are also good spells to have.  (Even if I did send my last fireball
winging out at a Lich - killed it and discovered I had wasted my fireball
on a chameleon(sp?)).  Another great one is Remove Curse.  Really handy
when you're wielding a cursed pick-axe.

BTW, I am playing a wizard, so I have a lot of power points, and a really
good chance of learning any spellbook I pick up, buy even my Knight could
use some of those spells.



